WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.612
Each environment gets one settings file,

2
00:00:02.612 --> 00:00:05.475
copied from the template
onto agency storage.

3
00:00:05.475 --> 00:00:08.719
Fill every placeholder: the
tenant, the output root,

4
00:00:08.719 --> 00:00:13.352
the groups that Privileged Identity
Management governs, the emergency

5
00:00:13.352 --> 00:00:18.063
access groups and accounts, and every
input file the earlier chapters use.

6
00:00:18.063 --> 00:00:20.422
No secret ever goes in a settings file:

7
00:00:20.422 --> 00:00:25.599
the run signs in through Privileged Identity
Management, or as a managed identity.

8
00:00:25.599 --> 00:00:29.750
The cloud is GCC, the Graph
environment is Global.

9
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:34.652
Every step in this runbook has two forms:
a fixture form with an environment file,

10
00:00:34.652 --> 00:00:38.880
which is what these slides show, and
the live form, which leaves it out.
